      "Upstream issue 521 remains OPEN; its reason-code ambiguity is not evidence that resorption biology is invalid or permission to reactivate an old morphology identifier.",
      "The upstream ontology description explicitly emphasizes bacterial and archaeal traits. A microbial-eukaryote proposal needs explicit maintainer scope review rather than an implicit claim of upstream adoption."
